@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Learn more about me";
}

<div class="container mt-4">

    <h1 class="mb-2">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <p class="lead mb-4">What better way to learn about a person than through their hobbies.</p>

    <!-- Painting and Drawing -->
    <div class="card shadow-sm mb-3">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">🎨 Painting & Drawing</h5>
            <p class="card-text">
                Painting and drawing are my creative outlet. I love being able to express emotions and ideas 
                visually — there is something deeply satisfying about turning a blank canvas into something 
                meaningful. It also helps me slow down and be present in the moment.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Jogging -->
    <div class="card shadow-sm mb-3">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">🏃‍♀️ Jogging</h5>
            <p class="card-text">
                Jogging is how I clear my head. Whether it is early in the morning or after a long day, 
                a good run helps me reset mentally and stay physically active. It has taught me a lot 
                about consistency and pushing through when things get tough.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Hiking -->
    <div class="card shadow-sm mb-3">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">🥾 Hiking</h5>
            <p class="card-text">
                I love hiking because it combines adventure with nature. There is nothing quite like 
                reaching the top of a trail and taking in the view. It reminds me that the best rewards 
                come after putting in the effort — something that carries over into my work as a developer too.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Singing -->
    <div class="card shadow-sm mb-3">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">🎤 Singing</h5>
            <p class="card-text">
                Singing is pure joy for me. Whether I am alone at home or with others, music has a way 
                of lifting my mood instantly. It is one of those hobbies that does not require any equipment — 
                just a voice and a song you love.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Journaling -->
    <div class="card shadow-sm mb-3">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">📓 Journaling</h5>
            <p class="card-text">
                Journaling helps me reflect and stay grounded. Writing down my thoughts, goals, and 
                experiences gives me clarity and helps me track how much I have grown over time. 
                It is a habit I wish I had started sooner.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>